OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSevere gales
OL,6,Fat first, strongest towards the Moray
OL,7,Fand north Aberdeenshire coast, will
OL,8,Fgradually ease through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight. Scattered showers at first,
OL,10,Fbecoming dry with clear spells
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry and bright in the morning.
OL,14,FCloud and rain spread north through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon and evening and becoming
OL,16,Frather windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
